  "updated_at": "2026-04-07",
  "bio": "Soner Erol is a highly proficient watercolor tattoo artist based in the vibrant neighborhood of Cihangir, Istanbul, Turkey. Their studio, @artstagetattoo, is renowned for not only the exceptional artistry but also the immaculate cleanliness that clients can trust. With an eye for detail and a passion for color, Soner transforms skin into a canvas of beautiful, lasting artwork.\nPrice: $\nCurrent location: Istanbul, Istanbul, Turkey"
}